# Byte-exact checkouts.
#
# This repository documents SHA-256 hashes in two places: the 11 adopted starter
# files are verified against `.paybox-starter/manifest.json`, and
# `SUBMISSION.md` quotes the hash of the bundled artifact. Git's default
# `core.autocrlf` behaviour on Windows would rewrite line endings on checkout and
# silently change those bytes, so every file is forced to LF and the artifact is
# excluded from conversion entirely.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The artifact is a build output whose hash is published, not source. It is kept
# out of line-ending conversion so the committed bytes are exactly the built
# bytes.
dist/plugin.mjs -text

# Real binaries, should any ever be added.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
